- type: link
  label: Cafe API
  link: docs/openapi
  routeSlug: docs/openapi
  content:
    contentType: overview
    meta:
      name: Cafe API
    children:
      - nodeType: container
        panels:
          - title: Download OpenAPI description
            titleTranslationKey: download.description.title
            children:
              - kind: download
                label: Test Server
                url: https://example.com/openapi/schema.yaml
              - kind: download
                label: Test Server 2
                url: https://example.com/openapi/schema.yaml
          - title: Overview
            titleTranslationKey: info.title
            children:
              - kind: externallink
                title: URL
                titleTranslationKey: info.contact.url
                label: https://github.com/Redocly/redoc
                url: https://github.com/Redocly/redoc
              - kind: email
                title: API Support
                email: apiteam@cafe-api.example.com
                label: apiteam@cafe-api.example.com
                withCopyButton: true
                copyContent: apiteam@cafe-api.example.com
              - kind: externallink
                title: License
                titleTranslationKey: info.license
                label: Apache 2.0
                url: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.html
              - kind: externallink
                label: Terms of Service
                labelTranslationKey: info.termsOfService
                url: http://swagger.io/terms/
          - title: Languages
            titleTranslationKey: languages.title
            children:
              - kind: languages
                options:
                  - key: curl
                    title: curl
                    lang: curl
                  - key: javascript
                    title: JavaScript
                    lang: JavaScript
                  - key: node
                    title: Node.js
                    lang: Node.js
                  - key: python
                    title: Python
                    lang: Python
                  - key: java
                    title: Java
                    lang: Java
                  - key: csharp
                    title: C#
                    lang: C#
                  - key: php
                    title: PHP
                    lang: PHP
                  - key: go
                    title: Go
                    lang: Go
                  - key: ruby
                    title: Ruby
                    lang: Ruby
                  - key: r
                    title: R
                    lang: R
                  - key: payload
                    title: Payload
                    lang: Payload
          - title: Servers
            titleTranslationKey: servers.title
            children:
              - kind: servers
                servers:
                  - url: //cafe-api.example.com/v2
                    description: Default server
                  - url: //cafe-api.example.com/sandbox
                    description: Sandbox server
                mode: default
        children:
          - nodeType: overview-section-wrapper
            children:
              - nodeType: header
                level: 1
                label: Cafe API (1.0.0)
                showPageActions: true
              - nodeType: markdoc
                content: My lovely Cafe API
              - nodeType: overview-section-wrapper
                children:
                  - nodeType: markdoc
                    content:
                      - >-
                        This is a sample Cafe API server. You can find out more about OpenAPI at
                        https://www.openapis.org/. For this sample, you can use the api key  to test the authorization
                        filters.
                sectionId: docs/openapi
              - nodeType: external-docs
                url: https://github.com/Rebilly/generator-openapi-repo
                description: Find out how to create Github repo for your OpenAPI spec.
            sectionId: docs/openapi
          - nodeType: overview-section-wrapper
            children:
              - nodeType: markdoc
                content:
                  - Introduction
                  - >-
                    This API is documented in OpenAPI format and is designed to demonstrate a modern cafe management
                    system with menu items, orders, and customer management. It was extended to illustrate features of
                    generator-openapi-repo tool and ReDoc documentation. In addition to standard OpenAPI syntax we use a
                    few vendor extensions.
            sectionId: docs/openapi/section/introduction
          - nodeType: overview-section-wrapper
            children:
              - nodeType: markdoc
                content:
                  - OpenAPI Specification
                  - >-
                    This API is documented in OpenAPI format and is designed to demonstrate a modern cafe management
                    system with menu items, orders, and customer management. It was extended to illustrate features of
                    generator-openapi-repo tool and ReDoc documentation. In addition to standard OpenAPI syntax we use a
                    few vendor extensions.
            sectionId: docs/openapi/section/openapi-specification
          - nodeType: overview-section-wrapper
            children:
              - nodeType: markdoc
                content:
                  - Cross-Origin Resource Sharing
                  - >-
                    This API features Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) implemented in compliance with  W3C spec. And
                    that allows cross-domain communication from the browser. All responses have a wildcard same-origin
                    which makes them completely public and accessible to everyone, including any code on any site.
            sectionId: docs/openapi/section/cross-origin-resource-sharing
          - nodeType: overview-section-wrapper
            children:
              - nodeType: markdoc
                content:
                  - Authentication
                  - 'Cafe API offers two forms of authentication:'
                  - >-
                    API Key OAuth2 OAuth2 - an open protocol to allow secure authorization in a simple and standard
                    method from web, mobile and desktop applications.
            sectionId: docs/openapi/section/authentication
